35,2,1,talk,May,,The clerk says a permanent build needs four months and five signatures.,"{""words"":12,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
36,2,1,talk,Mizuki,,The station block's bin house smells worse than the open pile.,"{""words"":11,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
37,2,1,talk,Kenji,,"The subsidy only covers forty percent, capped at ninety thousand yen.","{""words"":11,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
38,2,1,talk,Midori,,The complaint log shows eleven entries from the gate household.,"{""words"":10,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
39,2,1,talk,Servas,,The truck arrives between seven forty and eight fifteen.,"{""words"":9,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
