41,2,2,talk,Mizuki,,"@Servas, that window starts before most of us wake up.","{""words"":10,""mentions"":[""Servas""],""raw_differs"":false}"
42,2,2,talk,Kenji,,The ledger shows thirty-four thousand yen a year in extra fees.,"{""words"":11,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
43,2,2,talk,Midori,,"@May, the frontages are very uneven. One is only ninety centimetres.","{""words"":11,""mentions"":[""May""],""raw_differs"":false}"
