47,2,3,talk,Kenji,,We are paying for bags left open. We need discipline.,"{""words"":10,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
48,2,3,talk,Midori,,The gate household is clearly the most affected.,"{""words"":8,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
49,2,3,talk,Servas,,"If we do managed hours, who gets up at six?","{""words"":10,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
50,2,4,talk,May,,I don't want to sign something that ignores the gate house.,"{""words"":11,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
51,2,4,talk,Mizuki,,"Rotating might be fairer, but the frontages are tricky.","{""words"":9,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
